    {
      "name": "dsh-system-fonts",
      "title": {
        "en": "System fonts",
        "zh": "系统字体"
      },
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/HwFee/HwFee-dsh/master/plugins/system-fonts/icon.svg",
      "description": {
        "en": "Adds system-font pickers for text, code and terminal fonts to Settings → General, plus an interface font and an Inline code size stepper, with line-height and letter-spacing controls; enumerates installed Windows fonts. Sizes for the body and terminal, and every weight, stay with the host theme; the interface font's size follows the body by default, and the inline-code size affects inline code only.",
        "zh": "为「设置 → 通用」增加内容字体、代码字体、终端字体三个系统字体选择器，加界面字体与「行内代码」字号步进器，附行距与字距控制；从 Windows 已安装字体枚举。正文与终端的字号、以及全部字重仍由宿主主题管理；界面字体的字号默认跟随正文，行内代码字号只作用于行内代码。"
      },
      "repository": {
        "url": "https://github.com/HwFee/HwFee-dsh",
        "directory": "plugins/system-fonts"
